Yes. Use strict JSON (double quotes only). Example:
{
  "edits_by_year_total_through_2022": 1234,
  "edits_by_month_2023": {
    "2023-01": 1,
    "2023-02": 2,
    "2023-03": 3,
    "2023-04": 4,
    "2023-05": 5,
    "2023-06": 6
  }
}
No trailing commas, no comments, no extra conversational text—just the JSON.
